{"author":{"id":"00f627701a9269dee677db6aeaf21b9ca492295e9c85bdab1389f046efe9e77e"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1793270017,"nonce":"HHnXCydvbhoMoPNxl1QrNWk5Xtw=","title":"Phase 2: Context3D state machine, PipelineCache, and HXSL stock shaders","message":"Implement OpenFL's hardware `Context3D` pipeline on `hlwgpu`:\n\n- `puffpuff.gpu.PipelineCache`: Map OpenFL blend modes, depth/stencil states, and vertex buffer layouts to cached `GpuPipeline` objects.\n- `puffpuff.gpu.WgpuContext3D`: State tracker and command batcher backing `openfl.display3D.Context3D` (`setBlendFactors`, `setDepthTest`, `setProgram`, `setVertexBufferAt`, `drawTriangles`, `drawQuads`).\n- Stock shaders in HXSL compiled to WGSL via `hlwgpu.hxsl` (`DisplayObjectShader`, `GraphicsShader`, `BitmapFillShader`).\n- Vertex/index buffers (`VertexBuffer3D`, `IndexBuffer3D`) and textures (`RectangleTexture`, `Texture`) backed by `hlwgpu`.","files":null}]}